= ##
- cursor match
+ cursor match

-   case Media["image/jpeg"](jpeg) => t"a JPEG"
+   case Media["image/jpeg"](jpeg) => t"a JPEG"

-   case _                         => t"something else"
+   case _                         => t"something else"

=   case _                         => t"something else"
- ```
