- #### How certain a detection is
+ #### Qué grado de certeza tiene una detección

- A few opening bytes rarely prove what a stream is, and a `Detection` says in its type how much
- was established. `png` above is a `Detection of "image/png" under Likely to (Raster in Png)`:
- content detected as `image/png`, with a certainty of `Likely`, which is read as a `Raster in Png`.
- The certainty is one of three, fixed by what the detector examined:
+ Unos pocos bytes iniciales rara vez prueban qué es un flujo, y una `Detection` dice en su tipo
+ cuánto se ha establecido. `png`, arriba, es una
+ `Detection of "image/png" under Likely to (Raster in Png)`: contenido detectado como
+ `image/png`, con una certeza `Likely`, que se lee como un `Raster in Png`. La certeza es uno de
+ tres niveles, fijado por lo que examinó el detector:

= The certainty is one of three, fixed by what the detector examined:
=
- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Certainty
- column  What was examined
- column  Example
- row  `Plausible`  something merely consistent with the format, which reserves no identifying structure or keeps it out of reach  a leading `{` for JSON; a leading `<` for XML
- row  `Likely`  the structure which the format's specification designates as identifying, found where the specification puts it  the eight-byte PNG signature; the index at the end of a ZIP file
- row  `Certain`  the whole of the content, validated  none is provided: it means reading the entire stream
+ column  Certeza
+ column  Qué se examinó
+ column  Ejemplo
+ row  `Plausible`  algo simplemente coherente con el formato, que no reserva ninguna estructura identificativa o la deja fuera de alcance  una `{` inicial para JSON; un `<` inicial para XML
+ row  `Likely`  la estructura que la especificación del formato designa como identificativa, encontrada donde la sitúa la especificación  la firma de ocho bytes de PNG; el índice al final de un fichero ZIP
+ row  `Certain`  la totalidad del contenido, validada  no se proporciona ninguno: implica leer el flujo entero

= row  `Certain`  the whole of the content, validated  none is provided: it means reading the entire stream
- ```
+ ```

- A `Likely` match is wrong only by coincidence or forgery, and says nothing about the rest of the
- content being well-formed. A `Plausible` match can be wrong by design: other formats legitimately
- begin the same way, so the order of `Plausible` cases matters where the order of `Likely` ones
- does not.
+ Una coincidencia `Likely` solo es errónea por casualidad o por falsificación, y no dice nada de
+ si el resto del contenido está bien formado. Una coincidencia `Plausible` puede ser errónea por
+ diseño: otros formatos empiezan legítimamente de la misma manera, así que el orden de los casos
+ `Plausible` importa, mientras que el de los `Likely` no.

- Each level is a subtype of the one before it — `Certain <: Likely <: Plausible` — so a demand for
- at least a certainty is a bound. A second type argument to the pattern makes that demand of the
- detector, and a method makes it of a `Detection` it is given:
+ Cada nivel es un subtipo del anterior —`Certain <: Likely <: Plausible`— así que exigir al menos
+ una certeza es una cota. Un segundo argumento de tipo en el patrón plantea esa exigencia al
+ detector, y un método la plantea a una `Detection` que recibe:

= detector, and a method makes it of a `Detection` it is given:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- def decode(detection: Detection of "image/png" under (? <: Likely)): Text = t"decoding"
+ def decode(detection: Detection of "image/png" under (? <: Likely)): Text = t"decoding"

= def decode(detection: Detection of "image/png" under (? <: Likely)): Text = t"decoding"
=
